name calcage
category Package
revision 27725
shortdesc Calculate the age of something, in years
relocated 1
longdesc The package calculates the age of someone or something in
longdesc years. Internally it uses the datenumber package to calculate
longdesc the age in days; conversion from days to years is then
longdesc performed, taking care of leap years and such odd things.
